1601
01:01:01,138 --> 01:01:03,471
- At your command, Eteocles.

1602
01:01:05,272 --> 01:01:06,557
- I shall confront them.

1603
01:01:06,557 --> 01:01:08,090
- What, does he have his
lines written on that thing?

1604
01:01:08,090 --> 01:01:11,116
- On top of the sacred gate of Delphi.

1605
01:01:11,116 --> 01:01:12,783
- Delphi rules! Woo!

1606
01:01:14,589 --> 01:01:15,827
- What is that?

1607
01:01:15,827 --> 01:01:16,779
- Uh, the wind, sir?

1608
01:01:16,779 --> 01:01:20,005
- People around Thebes taking
refuge in the city, sire.

1609
01:01:20,005 --> 01:01:21,079
