1620
01:01:37,605 --> 01:01:38,997
- To markers.

1621
01:01:38,997 --> 01:01:40,774
- But I've got a plan for Creon.

1622
01:01:40,774 --> 01:01:42,891
- And it just might work.

1623
01:01:42,891 --> 01:01:44,775
- For now, close up the gates to the city.

1624
01:01:44,775 --> 01:01:46,060
Close them!

1625
01:01:46,060 --> 01:01:47,440
No one is to enter Thebes anymore!

1626
