1642
01:02:32,254 --> 01:02:34,496
♫ Don't you want me, baby ♫

1643
01:02:34,496 --> 01:02:36,284
- You would never understand.

1644
01:02:36,284 --> 01:02:37,477
- Really?

1645
01:02:37,477 --> 01:02:39,184
