can never hold Hercules.

1656
01:02:54,309 --> 01:02:56,141
- You think I don't know that?

1657
01:02:56,141 --> 01:02:58,646
- I curse the day he entered this palace.

1658
01:02:58,646 --> 01:02:59,943
- Hi, what you talking about?

1659
01:02:59,943 --> 01:03:02,236
- You curse the day I
entered your palace on folly.

1660
01:03:02,236 --> 01:03:03,069
- Huh!

1661
01:03:04,857 --> 01:03:07,506
- I was able to pull the threads together.

1662
01:03:07,506 --> 01:03:09,089
