makes you believe that?

1669
01:03:23,632 --> 01:03:26,333
- You, yourself, Hercules.

1670
01:03:26,333 --> 01:03:29,263
You won't kill me because
you know how much I love you.

1671
01:03:29,263 --> 01:03:30,690
